1
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,800
Claire!

2
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:11,200
<v Claire>Oh, Steve...

3
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:33,300
<v Steve>You're... warm.

4
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:38,200
<v Claire>Steve, you've got to hang in there, okay?

5
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:43,200
<v Claire>My brother's come to save us. We're getting out of here.

6
00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:48,900
<v Steve>Your... brother kept his promise.

7
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:52,800
<v Steve>I'm sorry, I cannot...

8
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,800
<v Claire>What? What are you saying?

9
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:58,600
<v Steve>I'm glad that I met you.

10
00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:04,800
<v Steve>I... I love you, Claire.

11
00:02:14,100 --> 00:02:19,200
<v Claire>Steve? Steve? Steve?

